//? Title: Classical RK4: actual four-stage states, convergence and stability
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Approximate an initial-value differential equation at discrete times with a
known derivative-evaluation budget. The classical fourth-order method samples
four derivative stages per step. Native histories now retain those exact
callback inputs and outputs. The original decay/growth problems and Euler
convergence comparison remain, with explicit malformed-derivative and stability
controls.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

For state y at time t and step h, classical RK4 computes k1=f(t,y),
k2=f(t+h/2,y+h*k1/2), k3=f(t+h/2,y+h*k2/2), k4=f(t+h,y+h*k3), then
$$ y_{n+1}=y_n+\frac h6(k_1+2k_2+2k_3+k_4). $$
\alttext(Four actual derivative stages form a weighted state update with weights one, two, two, one.)
Under smoothness and stability assumptions, global error is O(h^4); halving h
asymptotically reduces error by about 16. On y'=lambda*y the stability
polynomial is R(z)=1+z+z^2/2+z^3/6+z^4/24. Finite arithmetic and successful
completion do not imply stability or small integration error.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/runge_kutta4_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto t = a::runge_kutta4_trace([](double, const auto &y) {
        return y;
    }, {1}, 0, 1, 1);
    const auto &s = t.steps[0];
    std::print("| actual stage | queried time | state | derivative |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| k1 | " "{} | {} | {} |\n| k2 | {} | {} | {} |\n| k3 | {} | {} | {} |\n| k4 | {} | {} | {} |\n",
               s.time, s.before[0], s.k1[0], s.midpoint_time, s.second[0],
               s.k2[0], s.midpoint_time, s.third[0], s.k3[0], s.endpoint_time,
               s.fourth[0], s.k4[0]);
    std::print("Actual committed value {}; actual callback calls {}.\n",
               s.after[0], t.rhs_calls);
    g::Diagram d(48, 1100);
    d.node("n0", {0, 0}, std::format("Actual initial y={}", s.before[0]));
    d.node("n1", {5, 0},
           std::format("Actual midpoint stages {} / {}", s.k2[0], s.k3[0]));
    d.node("n2", {10, 0}, std::format("Actual committed y={:.8g}", s.after[0]));
    d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    d.save_svg("build/runge_kutta4_tiny.svg");
}
```
